   ```css
   /* Fixed rows, not `minmax(0, …)`: each lane is its own grid, so an empty zone must still hold
      its row open or the four bands would stop lining up across the five lanes. `--def-scale` is how
      far a DEF card shrinks (Card.tsx turns it with `rotate(90deg) scale(var(--def-scale, 1))`). A
      card on its side is as wide as it was tall and as tall as it was wide, so on a phone it is drawn
      as large as its unit zone's inside lets it, and never over its own size (#2556). The inside is
